From: SONiC Bazel Registry <securely1g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Identify the registered runtime-alternatives source snapshot

Keep the fetched module version equal to its registry entry. This registers
compiler, Automake and MPI installation links for Syncd's APT image layers.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 # Keep bazel_compatibility in sync with sonic-buildimage's .bazelversion.
 module(
     name = "sonic-build-infra",
-    version = "0.0.23",
+    version = "0.0.24-1edc72338fc6c79b737fc37d86ebd727969809c4",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
